# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

This is a neutral project seed. Product requirements, architecture, implementation,
checks and adoption decisions remain project-owned and pending. No inherited
Backbone task, PASS statement or source CI result qualifies this project.

Start with [contributing](CONTRIBUTING.md), the
[development command map](docs/operations/development.md),
[configuration and secrets](docs/operations/configuration.md), and
[project facts](.engineering-backbone/project.json).

Keep applicable components under `apps/`, shared libraries under `packages/`,
component code in `src/` and tests in `tst/`. Remove unused product placeholders.
Native dependency manifests and lockfiles stay beside their owning components.
Generated local outputs stay under `artifacts/<tool-or-run>/`; only
`artifacts/README.md` is tracked, and the outputs are not evidence or approval.
Common engineering policy is in [core](docs/agent-governance/core.md); requirements,
architecture, planning and testing remain connected through the common document
kits. This seed launches no host, installs no application or CI and proves no
native instruction loading or model permissions.

Use the separately reviewed source checkout's starter verifier. This repository
has no source-history validator or active Backbone workflows. Existing installations
must keep their own gates; this seed is not a downgrade/migration mechanism.
